  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.21-dev.64-alpha2\n\n- fix(i18n,backup,updates): backend responses follow UI language; LMS plugin/uuid backup fixes; stale cover art fix\n- fix(ui): show cursor in installer mode (CSS was overriding the X11 fix)\n- fix(distro): create /etc/default/grub if missing; drop Lyrion from the chroot\n- fix(distro): write install logs onto the target disk, not the live session\n- fix(distro): call grub-install directly for UEFI, regenerate grub.cfg, log finalize-boot\n- fix(distro): reconfigure shim-signed, not grub-efi-amd64-signed, for UEFI boot\n- fix(distro): rbind /sys for efivarfs, always show pointer in installer\n- fix(distro): stop live-config from hijacking lightdm autologin\n",
